COMPILATION OF: E46M22

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M22

   1 a 0000 E46M22:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] THE SECOND-ITEM GUARD: an ARRAY ELEMENT in
   4 a 0006      position 2. E46L10 pins `list(a(1))' as a my-gap in position
   5 a 0006      1, and a list is where an `authorize only the first item' bug
   6 a 0006      would show. */
   7 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, arr(3) fixed;
   8 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('M22OUT DAT');
   9 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v,arr(2));
  10 c 0046   close file(outf);
  11 a 004C end E46M22;

CODE SIZE = 004F
DATA AREA = 0025
FREE SYMS = 3887
END  COMPILATION
